<title>USA: ILLINOIS DIRECT HOGS STEADY/$0.50 UP - USDA.</title>
<headline>ILLINOIS DIRECT HOGS STEADY/$0.50 UP - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady-$0.50 higher. Demand moderate. Top $57.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>- USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2   230-260 lbs.  55.50-56.50, some 57.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   230-260 lbs.  54.50-55.50</p>
<p>  Sows: Steady to firm. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-400 lbs. 42.00-44.00</p>
<p>	   400-500 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>	   500-600 lbs. 46.00-48.00</p>
<p>few over 600 lbs. 47.50-49.00</p>
</text>
